<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Technology Partner for Oman | AI, Software &amp; Integration — BTS</title>
<meta name="description" content="BTS helps organisations in Oman turn complex operations into connected digital systems — AI automation, business intelligence, custom software, bilingual systems, integration and logistics technology.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://btsapp.net/locations/oman.html">
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="ar" href="https://btsapp.net/locations/oman.ar.html">
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://btsapp.net/locations/oman.html">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/style.css">
