<!-- ═══════════════ 1. HERO — Muscat ═══════════════ -->
<section class="bts-img-hero" style="background-image: linear-gradient(95deg, rgba(11,26,43,.92) 0%, rgba(11,26,43,.72) 30%, rgba(11,26,43,.20) 60%, rgba(11,26,43,.05) 100%), url('../assets/images/locations/muscat-hero.jpg');">
  <div class="bts-img-hero-wrap">
    <div class="bts-img-hero-inner">
      <span class="bts-hero-eyebrow">Oman</span>
      <h1>Technology for Oman's <em>next chapter</em>.</h1>
      <p class="bts-img-hero-lead">BTS helps organisations across Muscat, Duqm, Sohar and Salalah modernise operations — AI automation, business intelligence, custom software, bilingual enterprise systems and logistics technology.</p>
      <div class="bts-hero-cta">
        <a href="../en.html#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Project</a>
        <a href="#vision" class="btn btn-outline">Oman Vision 2040</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ 2. THE BTS DIFFERENCE FOR OMAN ═══════════════ -->
<section class="bts-section light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bts-head">
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <span class="kicker">Why BTS in Oman</span>
      <h2>Four capabilities shaped by Omani operating realities.</h2>
      <p>Every engagement in Oman starts with these principles.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bts-pillars">
      <div class="bts-pillar">
        <span class="num">01 · LOGISTICS-FIRST</span>
        <h3>Built for Oman's port and trade economy</h3>
        <p>Systems designed around Duqm, Sohar and Salalah — customs documents, shipment tracking, warehouse operations and cross-border trade workflows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-pillar">
        <span class="num">02 · ARABIC + ENGLISH</span>
        <h3>Bilingual by default</h3>
        <p>Interfaces, documents and workflows designed together for Arabic and English users — not translated later.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-pillar">
        <span class="num">03 · REMOTE DELIVERY</span>
        <h3>UK engineering, delivered remotely</h3>
        <p>Delivery coordination and engineering from Glasgow — with engagement models designed for Omani organisations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-pillar">
        <span class="num">04 · IN-COUNTRY VALUE</span>
        <h3>Built with Oman's ICV expectations in mind</h3>
        <p>Local capability, documentation and knowledge transfer designed to support in-country value objectives from the start.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ 3. WHERE WE HELP ═══════════════ -->
<section class="bts-section navy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bts-head">
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <span class="kicker">Where we help</span>
      <h2>Six areas where we deliver measurable improvement.</h2>
      <p>Each capability is built for the specific demands of Omani enterprises, industry, ports and public organisations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bts-services">
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>AI Automation</h3>
        <p>Document processing, WhatsApp workflows, approvals and repetitive operations — automated for Omani enterprise volumes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>Business Intelligence</h3>
        <p>Executive dashboards, operational analytics and data pipelines for multi-entity and multi-port visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>Custom Software</h3>
        <p>Internal platforms, client portals and business applications built around how your organisation actually works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>Bilingual Systems</h3>
        <p>Arabic-first platforms with native RTL, Arabic documents and workflows designed for both languages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>System Integration</h3>
        <p>ERP, CRM, WMS, customs and operational systems connected through one reliable integration layer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <h3>Logistics &amp; Warehouse</h3>
        <p>Warehouse management, shipment tracking, customs documentation and route planning for Omani trade corridors.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ 4. OMAN VISION 2040 ALIGNMENT ═══════════════ -->
<section class="bts-section navy" id="vision">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bts-head">
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <span class="kicker">Oman Vision 2040</span>
      <h2>Where our work connects to Oman's long-term direction.</h2>
      <p>Oman Vision 2040 sets out a path toward a diversified, knowledge-driven economy — supported by the Digital Economy Programme, the National Logistics Strategy and the in-country value initiative. Our services are built to help organisations move with that direction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bts-v2030">
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">AI Automation</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Applied automation in real operations, aligned with Oman's digital transformation agenda.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">Business Intelligence</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Data-driven decisions and clearer operational visibility for Omani leadership teams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">Custom Software</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Digital platforms that build local capability and reduce dependence on generic tools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">Bilingual Systems</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Arabic-first platforms serving Oman's bilingual population natively.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">System Integration</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Connected ecosystems across enterprise, ports, industry and public-sector operations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-v2030-row">
        <div class="bts-v2030-key">Logistics &amp; Warehouse</div>
        <p class="bts-v2030-val">Supporting Oman's position as a logistics gateway between the Gulf, Asia and East Africa.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="bts-v2030-note">Practical systems that help Omani organisations move faster — through technology built for real operations.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ 5. HOW WE WORK ═══════════════ -->
<section class="bts-section light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bts-head">
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <span class="kicker">How we work</span>
      <h2>From first conversation to working system.</h2>
      <p>Three phases. Each delivers something usable before the next begins.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bts-phases">
      <div class="bts-phase">
        <div class="bts-phase-num">01</div>
        <h3>Discover</h3>
        <p class="bts-phase-lead">We map the process, agree the scope, and define the data model behind the system. You see a working prototype before development begins.</p>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">Typical duration</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">2 weeks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">You receive</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">Scoped requirements, data model, clickable prototype</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bts-phase featured">
        <div class="bts-phase-num">02</div>
        <h3>Build</h3>
        <p class="bts-phase-lead">We develop the system in short iterations — with your team seeing progress throughout, and every feature tested against real data before it ships.</p>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">Typical duration</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">6–10 weeks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">You receive</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">Working system, integration to your tools, tested in your environment</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bts-phase">
        <div class="bts-phase-num">03</div>
        <h3>Handover</h3>
        <p class="bts-phase-lead">We deploy, train your team, document the system, and stay available for iteration. The software becomes yours — no lock-in, no proprietary dependency.</p>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">Typical duration</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">Ongoing</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bts-phase-meta">
          <span class="bts-phase-label">You receive</span>
          <span class="bts-phase-value">Deployment, team training, documentation, iteration support</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="bts-phases-note">The best software is not the most advanced. It is the one your team actually uses every day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

